      "code": "DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY",
      "text": "Basketball strategies and player performance can evolve across seasons, meaning effects observed in earlier seasons might not hold true for later ones, or vice-versa. This was noted as a risk in FAM:SF-APPA-050."
